message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Explainable Lightweight Transformers for Malicious IoT Traffic Detection"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package: a fine-tuned DistilBERT over a textual serialization
  of CICIoT2023 flow windows, benchmarked against classical baselines, with a
  dual-method (Captum Integrated Gradients + SHAP) explainability and
  explanation-robustness analysis.
